IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. MENU-TEST.

*> 這份檢查器不需要修改，是這一題的驗收標準。

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  CK-TAG    PIC X(12).
01  CK-99     PIC 99.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
COBLINGS-TEST-MAIN.
*> GO TO 跳過的段落不該有副作用
*> GO TO SKIP-DONE 會離開 SKIP-BLOCK，所以要用 THRU 把 SKIP-DONE 也包進 PERFORM 範圍，
*> 控制權才會在 SKIP-DONE 結束後回到這裡（COBOL 常見的 PERFORM x THRU x-EXIT 寫法）
    PERFORM SKIP-BLOCK THRU SKIP-DONE
    MOVE WS-TAG TO CK-TAG
    CALL "COBLINGS-EXPECT-EQUALS"
        USING BY CONTENT "SKIP-BLOCK：跳轉後 WS-TAG 要停在 BEFORE"
              BY CONTENT "BEFORE       "
              BY CONTENT CK-TAG
    MOVE WS-SIDE-COUNT TO CK-99
    CALL "COBLINGS-EXPECT-EQUALS"
        USING BY CONTENT "SKIP-BLOCK：被跳過的敘述不該執行"
              BY CONTENT 0
              BY CONTENT CK-99

*> DEPENDING ON：值對得到目標
    MOVE 1 TO WS-STEP
    PERFORM DISPATCH-BY-STEP THRU TARGET-HIT
    MOVE WS-HIT-COUNT TO CK-99
    CALL "COBLINGS-EXPECT-EQUALS"
        USING BY CONTENT "WS-STEP = 1 應跳到 TARGET-HIT"
              BY CONTENT 1
              BY CONTENT CK-99
    MOVE WS-MISS-COUNT TO CK-99
    CALL "COBLINGS-EXPECT-EQUALS"
        USING BY CONTENT "WS-STEP = 1 時不該執行下一行"
              BY CONTENT 0
              BY CONTENT CK-99

*> DEPENDING ON：值超出目標範圍 → 不跳，往下繼續
    MOVE 2 TO WS-STEP
    PERFORM DISPATCH-BY-STEP THRU TARGET-HIT
    MOVE WS-MISS-COUNT TO CK-99
    CALL "COBLINGS-EXPECT-EQUALS"
        USING BY CONTENT "WS-STEP = 2 超出範圍，應繼續往下執行"
              BY CONTENT 1
              BY CONTENT CK-99

*> 往回跳做迴圈
    MOVE 0 TO WS-COUNT
    PERFORM REPEAT-BLOCK
    MOVE WS-COUNT TO CK-99
    CALL "COBLINGS-EXPECT-EQUALS"
        USING BY CONTENT "REPEAT-BLOCK：GO TO 往回跳，應數到 3"
              BY CONTENT 3
              BY CONTENT CK-99

    CALL "COBLINGS-DONE"
    GOBACK.
